  "worked_solution": "A region $D$ is connected if every pair of points in $D$ can be joined by a smooth curve or a path in $D.$\n\nAmong the given options, the only one that satisfies this definition is the following:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/foundations/14163649/assets/4d7d916e62541ad8d41f6043c0d0e2f511f0b79d036f6fce6b4ce4500a357023.png)",
